		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23967#p23967"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>il vous faut générer l&#039;année et le mois. Par exemple :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>WITH a AS (select date_part(&#039;year&#039;, d) AS annee, date_part(&#039;month&#039;, d) AS mois from generate_series(&#039;2014-01-01&#039;::date, &#039;2016-12-01&#039;, &#039;1 month&#039;) d)
...</code></pre></div>]]></content>
